1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,036
The first step in the fabrication process

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:06,095
of the Anak Ayam Sejuk keris hilt is

3
00:00:06,119 --> 00:00:09,325
the selection of the appropriate

4
00:00:09,349 --> 00:00:12,000
type of wood.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,238
For example, the use of kemuning wood
or other hardwoods

6
00:00:16,262 --> 00:00:20,000
suitable to be made as keris hilt.

7
00:00:20,024 --> 00:00:22,012
I acquire my supply of kemuning wood

8
00:00:22,036 --> 00:00:24,024
from Kelantan and Terengganu.

9
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:28,747
The kemuning wood on the other hand are divided
into several types such as 

10
00:00:29,048 --> 00:00:30,494
kemuning emas wood,

11
00:00:30,518 --> 00:00:32,693
kemuning mati beragan wood

12
00:00:32,717 --> 00:00:37,048
and kemuning lada wood.

13
00:00:37,072 --> 00:00:39,060
The type of kemuning wood that I prefer

14
00:00:39,084 --> 00:00:41,072
and frequently use for fabrication as keris hilt,

15
00:00:41,096 --> 00:00:43,096
will be the kemuning mati beragan wood.

16
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,025
It matched perfectly due to its

17
00:00:45,049 --> 00:00:47,320
weight and compact wood veins

18
00:00:47,344 --> 00:00:53,344
which illuminate a beautiful pattern when carved.
